     The rriijjnnddaaeell__mmaakkeeKKeeyy() function is used to set up the key schedule in
     _k_e_y.  The _d_i_r_e_c_t_i_o_n (which may be DIR_ENCRYPT or DIR_DECRYPT) specifies
